  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Rate</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>reation</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Electrophilicity</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>alkyl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>carbon</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Steric</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>crowding</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>on</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;reaction depend upon&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>, effect.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;group increases&nbsp;the&nbsp;rate of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;reaction.</p>",
